[{'idx': 0, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Metropolitan City of Naples The Metropolitan City of Naples (Italian: "Città metropolitana di Napoli") is an Italian Metropolitan City in Campania region, established on January 1, 2015. Its capital city is Naples; within the city there are "92 comune (municipalities)". It was first created by the reform of local authorities (Law 142/1990) and established by the Law 56/2014, thus replacing the Province of Naples in 2015. The Metropolitan City of Naples is headed by the Metropolitan Mayor (Sindaco metropolitano) and by the Metropolitan Council (Consiglio metropolitano). Since 1 January 2015 its head is Luigi de Magistris, as mayor of the', 'title': 'Metropolitan City of Naples'}
