 {'idx': 20, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': "(she predeceased her father on June 6, 2012). Niemeyer subsequently had five grandchildren, thirteen great-grandchildren, and seven great-great-grandchildren. Annita died in 2004, at 93, after 76 years of marriage. In 2006, shortly before his 99th birthday, Niemeyer married for the second time, to his longtime secretary, Vera Lucia Cabreira at his apartment, a month after he had fractured his hip in a fall. Oscar Niemeyer was a keen smoker of cigars, smoking more in later life. His architectural studio was a smoking zone. Niemeyer had a leftist political ideology. In 1945, many communist militants who were arrested under the Vargas'", 'title': 'Oscar Niemeyer'}
