 {'idx': 9, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Vicious (TV series) Vicious is a British television sitcom shown on ITV. The series stars Ian McKellen and Derek Jacobi as Freddie and Stuart, an elderly gay couple who have been together for 50 years but endure a love/hate relationship. The series premiered on 29 April 2013 with 5.78 million viewers. On 14 May 2016, McKellen and Jacobi appeared as Freddie and Stuart during the Eurovision Song Contest where they are seen watching the contest. In 2016, the show was cancelled by ITV and a finale special aired on 16 December 2016. "Vicious" is set around the lives of ageing', 'title': 'Vicious (TV series)'}
