[{'idx': 0, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian is a 2008 American high fantasy film based on "Prince Caspian", the second published, fourth chronological novel in C. S. Lewis\'s epic fantasy series, "The Chronicles of Narnia". It is the second in "The Chronicles of Narnia" film series from Walden Media, following "" (2005). William Moseley, Anna Popplewell, Skandar Keynes, Georgie Henley, Liam Neeson, and Tilda Swinton reprise their roles from the first film, while new cast includes Ben Barnes, Sergio Castellitto, Peter Dinklage, Eddie Izzard, Warwick Davis, Ken Stott, and Vincent Grass. In the film, the', 'title': 'The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian'}
