 {'idx': 3, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Seven Great Lords of Narnia The Seven Great Lords of Narnia are fictional characters in The Chronicles of Narnia by C. S. Lewis. They are briefly mentioned in "Prince Caspian" and are central to the plot in "The Voyage of the Dawn Treader", the second and third published books, respectively, in the series. In the book "Prince Caspian", Caspian overthrows Miraz, with the help of the Old Narnians, to take his rightful position as King of Narnia. In "The Voyage of the Dawn Treader" he sets sail for the Lone Islands and beyond to look for the seven lords who', 'title': 'Seven Great Lords of Narnia'}
