 {'idx': 7, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Cardamom Town (theme park) Cardamom Town () is a theme park located within the Kristiansand Zoo, made after the popular Norwegian children\'s book "When the Robbers Came to Cardamom Town" by Thorbjørn Egner. The theme park, which opened in 1991, was made to look exactly like it looks in the original illustrations in the book. Thorbjørn Egner got to see the theme park while it was under construction, but did not live long enough to see it completed. The theme park comprises 33 houses, eight of which are rental properties. During the summer actors would walk around the area of', 'title': 'Cardamom Town (theme park)'}]

