 {'idx': 4, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'The Return to Darkness The Return to Darkness is the third full-length album by the Indian Death metal band Demonic Resurrection. It was released on January 15, 2010 through Demonstealer Records. The band was signed to Candlelight Records for worldwide distribution. The album was released on Candlelight Records on July 12, 2010. The album has mostly received positive reviews. Critics have praised the band for improving upon their sound, stating, "...better production, tighter songwriting, better sounding symphonic elements and overall, a much more mature sound.". Critics also praised the atmosphere of the album. Some critics felt that the album was', 'title': 'The Return to Darkness'}]

