 {'idx': 4, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'this certainly got the crowd roaring. When Rhoads left the band, this song was never again performed. This solo was regularly performed, in different incarnations, with Ozzy on tour. It usually came near the end of "Suicide Solution", although Randy had to cut back the solo to just 2 minutes. One such incarnation of the solo appears on the "Tribute" album. The solo on the live album was from a different show (Montreal) than the rest of the album (Cleveland), and was haphazardly spliced in over the original for unknown reasons. Laughing Gas (instrumental) "Laughing Gas" was a song performed', 'title': 'Laughing Gas (instrumental)'}
